<title>UK: Grantchester to buy two UK retail parks.</title>
<headline>Grantchester to buy two UK retail parks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Grantchester Holdings Plc said on Tuesday it had agreed to buy two retail parks for a total of 24.75 million stg.</p>
</text>
